{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春二月，天王使家父來求車。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？王者無求；求車，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"二、三月乙未，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"三、夏四月己巳，葬齊僖公","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"四、五月，鄭伯突出奔蔡。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"突何以名？奪正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"五、鄭世子忽復歸于鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"其稱世子何？復正也。曷為或言歸？或言復歸？復歸者，出惡，歸無惡；復入者，出無惡，入有惡。入者，出入惡。歸者，出入無惡。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"六、許叔入于許。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯于鄗。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"八、邾婁人、牟人、葛人來朝。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"皆何以稱人？夷狄之也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"九、秋九月，鄭伯突入于櫟。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"櫟者何？鄭之邑。曷為不言入于鄭？末言爾。曷為末言爾？祭仲亡矣。然則曷為不言忽之出奔？言忽為君之微也。祭仲存則存矣，祭仲亡則亡矣！","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_26_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_26","textTraditional":"十、冬十有一月，公會齊侯、宋公、衞侯、陳侯于侈，伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}